* 10^5`.\n\n## Output\n\nFor each test case, output a binary string `s` of length `n`, the string you\nconstructed. Print `-1` if such a string does not exist.\n\nIf there are multiple answers, you may output any of them.\n\n## Example\n\n### Input\n\n```text\n8\n5 2\n4 3\n6 1\n5 0\n7 3\n4 2\n3 2\n7 4\n```\n\n### Output\n\n```text\n01110\n-1\n101001\n01010\n0100011\n0011\n-1\n0111000\n```\n\n## Note\n\nIn the first test case, one possible answer is `s = 01110`. It contains three\ncharacters `1` and two characters `0`, and there are exactly `2` adjacent\nequal pairs in `s`: `(s_2, s_3)` and `(s_3, s_4)`.\n\nIn the second test case, `k = n - 1`. All characters in `s` should be equal,\nso the numbers of characters `0` and `1` could not differ by at most `1`.\nThus, the answer is `-1`.\n\nIn the third test case, note that `010110` is also a possible answer.","type":"text"}],"contestId":2250,"index":"B","memoryLimit":"256 megabytes","name":"String Construction","problemKey":"2250-B","rating":null,"tags":["constructive algorithms"],"timeLimit":"1 second","url":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2250/problem/B"},{"approaches":[{"label":"Approach 1","number":1,"solutions":[{"code":"#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nstruct ForbiddenRanks {\n    int leftStart;\n    int leftEnd;\n    int rightStart;\n    int rightEnd;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n\n    int testCases;\n    cin >> testCases;\n\n    while (testCases--) {\n        int n;\n        cin >> n;\n\n        vector<ForbiddenRanks> elements(n);\n        for (ForbiddenRanks& element : elements) {\n            cin >> element.leftStart >> element.leftEnd;\n            cin >> element.rightStart >> element.rightEnd;\n        }\n\n        int answer = 0;\n        for (int length = n; length >= 1; --length) {\n            int nextPosition = 1;\n\n            for (const ForbiddenRanks& element : elements) {\n                if (nextPosition > length) {\n                    break;\n                }\n\n                const int rightRank = length - nextPosition + 1;\n                const bool leftRankAllowed =\n                    nextPosition < element.leftStart ||\n                    nextPosition > element.leftEnd;\n                const bool rightRankAllowed =\n                    rightRank < element.rightStart ||\n                    rightRank > element.rightEnd;\n\n                if (leftRankAllowed && rightRankAllowed) {\n                    ++nextPosition;\n                }\n            }\n\n            if (nextPosition == length + 1) {\n                answer = length;\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n\n        cout << answer << '\\n';\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 2","number":2,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 3","number":3,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 4","number":4,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 5","number":5,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 6","number":6,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 7","number":7,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 8","number":8,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 9","number":9,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 10","number":10,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 11","number":11,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 12","number":12,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 13","number":13,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 14","n